[HEADING=2]Changes in [DD] - Core Library 1.6.1[/HEADING]

[HEADING=3]Added[/HEADING]
[LIST]
[*][B]Release Automation - Resource Description Sync[/B]: Extended the reusable release workflow ([I]xenforo-release-publisher.yml[/I]) to automatically synchronize the XenForo Resource Manager (XFRM) description with [I]_docs/readme.de.bbcode[/I] (or fallback [I]readme.bbcode[/I]) via REST API ([I]POST /api/resources/{id}/[/I]) on each release.
[*][B]Icon Provider UI Showcase[/B]: Added [I]_docs/screenshots/icon-provider-select.png[/I] showcasing the icon provider selection dropdown in AdminCP.
[/LIST]
